    port1.0.10      8000:e01aead47043    8392   Designated   Forwarding
    port1.0.14      8000:889d98df2602    8396   Alternate    Discarding
    port1.0.16      8000:0000cd423029    8398   Rootport     Forwarding   <- NOW FORWARDING
    x960-28YSQ# show spanning-tree brief
    sa1             8000:0000cd423029    8195   Disabled     Discarding
    port1.0.16      8000:0000cd423029    8398   Designated   Forwarding   <- NOW FORWARDING

  Side effect, expected and reverted: swi_b's `sa1` lost its only live member (swi_b port1.0.2
